+   "title": "Check the base and rocker box gaskets",
+   "instructions": "Clean the engine and look for oil at the cylinder base, especially near the oil return, and at the rocker boxes. Plan a top-end reseal if they weep.",
+   "reason": "Base gasket leaks are the best-known Evo fault and get worse as the gasket bakes.",
